            <note corresp="#d125-f3" n="3" xml:id="d125-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 1083 from Cape Town, May 7, the Embassy transmitted the South African
                    Government’s reply to the March 26 letter. (National Archives, RG 59, Central
                    Foreign Policy File, D790207–0142)</p>
            </note>
